--- !u!114 &1898292482
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1898292480}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5ed11cbb11006e046a195f7f82b8ae58, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 1705817792}
  conversation:
  - speakerName: Leon
    sentenceText: Director General, it is done. I have secured all five diorama pieces
      from the thieves here in the Service Alley.
    documentPanelToShow: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Joel Francisco
    sentenceText: Great work, Officer. That is a huge relief. Those Baticulin pieces
      are too fragile to stay in the hands of those thieves any longer.
    documentPanelToShow: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Leon
    sentenceText: They are definitely easy to break. I can see why the Professor
      was worried about the wood splitting. What is the next move? Should I bring
      these back to the main vault?
    documentPanelToShow: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Joel Francisco
    sentenceText: Not yet. I want you to go to the Paete exhibit area. It is set
      up just outside the museum, in the nearby grounds.
    documentPanelToShow: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Leon
    sentenceText: An outside exhibit? Is it safe enough to fix the item?
    documentPanelToShow: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Joel Francisco
    sentenceText: We have set up guards there. Waiting for you is Paeng Malabanan.
      He is a famous artist from Paete, Laguna.
    documentPanelToShow: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Leon
    sentenceText: Is he an expert for this specific diorama?
    documentPanelToShow: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Joel Francisco
    sentenceText: "He is an expert in Paete woodcarvings in general. His family has
      been a line of manlililok\u2014traditional master carvers\u2014for generations
      in Paete. That diorama is a work of Paete art itself, and because the craft
      is in his blood, he understands the nature of that wood better than anyone.
      He will be the one to guide you in putting those fragments back together."
    documentPanelToShow: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Leon
    sentenceText: Understood. I am heading to the exhibit grounds now.
    documentPanelToShow: {fileID: 0}
  triggerTabletNotificationOnEnd: 0
  requiresPreviousNPCDone: 0
  preRequisiteNPC: {fileID: 0}
  lockedFallbackConversation: []
  isPhoneCaller: 1
  callerName: Mr. Francisco
  callerPhoneNumber: 0912345678
